  "explanation": {
    "en": "Rule used in this series: a break of structure needs a candle body close beyond the swing. A wick alone is a sweep candidate.",
    "bn": "এই series-এর নিয়ম: structure break-এ swing-এর বাইরে candle body close লাগে। শুধু wick হলো sweep-এর প্রার্থী।"
  },
  "keyTakeaways": [
    {
      "en": "Wick = not enough; wait for the close",
      "bn": "Wick যথেষ্ট নয়; close-এর অপেক্ষা"
    }
  ],
